│ randomized study, ectopic pregnancies may be completely avoided."}, {"study_index": 24, "title": "Role of EmbryoGlue │
│ as a transfer medium in the outcome of fresh non-donor in-vitro fertilization cycles", "abstract": "BACKGROUND       │
│ EmbryoGlue is a hyaluronan-enriched embryo transfer (ET) medium which aids in implantation of embryos, hence,        │
