│ were 81.8% and 71.4% respectively, a non-statistically significant difference. Hyaluronic acid can successfully      │
│ replace albumin as transfer medium."}, {"study_index": 29, "title": "Single blastocyst transfer: a prospective       │
│ randomized trial", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To determine the efficacy of single blastocyst transfer. DESIGN            │
