│ those undergoing WET in a hormone replacement cycle (WET-H [n\u2009=\u2009102]). On the day of ET, patients were     │
│ randomized to HETM (0.5 mg/ml hyaluronan) or control medium containing no hyaluronan. Only patients with good        │
│ quality embryos on day 3 were included. RESULTS For all three patients groups (fresh ET, WET-N and WET-H) pregnancy  │
