(IVF-ET). AIM To evaluate the role of EmbryoGlue in improving implantation and pregnancy rates. DESIGN AND SETTING A    
prospective case-control study conducted at assisted reproductive center of a tertiary care hospital. METHOD In 42 women
undergoing IVF, embryos were transferred into 50 μL of EmbryoGlue for 10 min prior to transfer inside uterine cavity. In
the control group (n = 42), embryos were transferred to conventional blastocyst culture medium. Statistical analysis was
